# CODEOWNERS — GitHub uses this to auto-request review on every PR.
# Format: <path-pattern> <owner …>

# Global default — every file falls back to the maintainer.
*                                       @affluentzombie

# Security-sensitive surfaces get an explicit callout so the auto-review
# request is visible in the PR check strip.
/SECURITY.md                            @affluentzombie
/.github/workflows/                     @affluentzombie
/.signpath/                             @affluentzombie
/src/Cinder.Core/Signatures/            @affluentzombie
/src/Cinder.Plugins/                    @affluentzombie
/src/Cinder.Imaging/Ewf/                @affluentzombie

# Docs edits still route to the maintainer today, but split them out so a
# future doc-maintainer role can be added without touching the pattern.
/README.md                              @affluentzombie
/CHANGELOG.md                           @affluentzombie
/ROADMAP.md                             @affluentzombie
/LIMITATIONS.md                         @affluentzombie
/TESTING.md                             @affluentzombie
/docs/                                  @affluentzombie
